      <p>Register or verify the supplied conversation components after the model profile is ready. Existing matching components and conversations are retained; no learner question is sent.</p>
      ```
    }
  )
  region collection (
    name: 4. Load the public collection
    type: staticContent
    layout {
      sequence: 60
      slot: body
    }
    appearance {
      template: @/standard
      templateOptions: #DEFAULT#
    }
    source {
      htmlCode:
      ```html
      <p>Fetch the package's approved dataset from a pinned public GitHub commit. The loader checks the manifest and content hashes, stages the data and builds the graph before activation. It does not fetch instructions from a moving branch.</p><p>A ready existing collection can be retained during an upgrade. A failed load must not replace it. If a request is interrupted, refresh readiness and review its recorded state before explicitly retrying.</p>
      <p role="status">Last recorded load: <strong>&P900_DATASET_STATUS!HTML.</strong><br>Last recorded phase: <strong>&P900_DATASET_PHASE!HTML.</strong></p>
      <p>Verified active collection: &P900_COLLECTION_COUNTS!HTML.</p>
      <p>These are recorded results, not a live percentage. Refresh readiness to check again; refreshing does not restart the load.</p>
      ```
    }
  )
  region enable (
    name: 5. Open learning
    type: staticContent
    layout {
      sequence: 70
      slot: body
    }
    appearance {
      template: @/standard
      templateOptions: #DEFAULT#
    }
    source {
      htmlCode:
      ```html
      <p>Enable learning only when every required check is ready. This removes the installation's maintenance gate so individual app accounts can use Sample Contexts and My Contexts.</p><p>The local embedding model is optional. Without it, context search uses keywords. Ask the facilitator to use the documented owner-only model setup if semantic search is needed; this page does not download model binaries.</p>
      ```
    }
  )
